{
  "id": "G006",
  "name": "NPC steering behaviours: seek, flee, arrive, pursuit (Yuka)",
  "description": "Simulates one non-player character (pedestrian, traffic car or police car) with Yuka's steering behaviours in 2D: seek a point, flee from a threat inside a panic radius, arrive and slow down at a point, or pursue a moving target by predicting where it will be. Integrates force, mass, max force and max speed per step and reports the trajectory and closest distance.",
